[00:00.57]1. We live in the time of the harvest,
[00:22.99]A priv’lege beyond all compare.
[00:26.65]The wheat fields stand ready before us,
[00:30.32]And eagerly we have a share.
[00:33.99]With Jesus, our finest example,
[00:39.49]Directing our work in the field,
[00:45.50]How happy and honored we feel each day.
[01:18.24]We joyfully share in the yield.
[01:50.97]2. True love for our God and our neighbor
[02:00.96]Now moves us to speed up our pace.
[02:08.76]Both preaching and teaching are urgent,
[02:16.76]For shortly the end we will face.
[02:28.58]The joy we receive is a blessing,
[02:33.60]A gift that Jehovah provides.
[02:38.62]By faith we endure till this work is done
[02:42.62]And joyfully share at his side.